From 6d92a51dd45e35b306a2be38292ef55db942face Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zouxiaojun <zouxiaojun@eswincomputing.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Apr 2025 14:59:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 458/552] fix(venc):opt venc log while pm resume/suspend

Changelogs:
opt venc log while pm resume/suspend

Signed-off-by: zouxiaojun <zouxiaojun@eswincomputing.com>
---
 .../staging/media/eswin/venc/vc8000e_driver.c | 28 ++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/eswin/venc/vc8000e_driver.c b/drivers/staging/media/eswin/venc/vc8000e_driver.c
index 0244069626c1..d241fb9096bf 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/eswin/venc/vc8000e_driver.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/eswin/venc/vc8000e_driver.c
@@ -1,3 +1,23 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * ESWIN encoder driver
